    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/2affd40a70f67ba906de4ea5907ec80c.webp?t=1741311128\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/bbda813ad61dd3d93de817afed3e03bd.poster.avif?t=1741311128\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/bbda813ad61dd3d93de817afed3e03bd.webm?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/bbda813ad61dd3d93de817afed3e03bd.mp4?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Party Bots supports up to 100 players in each lobby! Although, the use of powerful gaming computers is recommended in this case! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/ec927ebaf05b547ad4b0c12161a4ffa4.webp?t=1741311128\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/a35f3690ca88182323f66b176314b699.poster.avif?t=1741311128\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/a35f3690ca88182323f66b176314b699.webm?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/a35f3690ca88182323f66b176314b699.mp4?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>You start as a regular Y-Bot, but you don't have to look like everyone else! Customize your face, color, and hat to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/29bf414a131cd833e82b6b74c74f44da.webp?t=1741311128\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/12afa160e9d4f53bae6a9e20a26dd62d.poster.avif?t=1741311128\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/12afa160e9d4f53bae6a9e20a26dd62d.webm?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/12afa160e9d4f53bae6a9e20a26dd62d.mp4?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Explosions and lasers can destroy platforms in a dynamic and fun way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/1fc562cd225237b7fa597373c6852de3.webp?t=1741311128\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/70aa6344780172c4d49234b71eeae515.poster.avif?t=1741311128\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/70aa6344780172c4d49234b71eeae515.webm?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/70aa6344780172c4d49234b71eeae515.mp4?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Party Bots is full of new items to unlock. Are you lucky enough to get a really rare one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/c21745da221c25fa555395c03fdf7bb1.webp?t=1741311128\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/54f8a44abf3f259962e787a506aa31f9.poster.avif?t=1741311128\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/54f8a44abf3f259962e787a506aa31f9.webm?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/54f8a44abf3f259962e787a506aa31f9.mp4?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>You can take control of game modes yourself and change everything to your liking! Don't like the explosive barrels? Remove them! Want things to happen faster? Speed up the events! Is the game too easy for you? Make it harder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/7edeb92dcbd5147c791fd08c06eac3c8.webp?t=1741311128\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/3c6aab2b5e4474728152095b37250ba5.poster.avif?t=1741311128\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/3c6aab2b5e4474728152095b37250ba5.webm?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/3c6aab2b5e4474728152095b37250ba5.mp4?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>This can save you in the most dangerous situations, or just be fun!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/2affd40a70f67ba906de4ea5907ec80c.webp?t=1741311128\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/bbda813ad61dd3d93de817afed3e03bd.poster.avif?t=1741311128\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/bbda813ad61dd3d93de817afed3e03bd.webm?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/bbda813ad61dd3d93de817afed3e03bd.mp4?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Party Bots supports up to 100 players in each lobby! Although, the use of powerful gaming computers is recommended in this case! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/ec927ebaf05b547ad4b0c12161a4ffa4.webp?t=1741311128\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/a35f3690ca88182323f66b176314b699.poster.avif?t=1741311128\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/a35f3690ca88182323f66b176314b699.webm?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/a35f3690ca88182323f66b176314b699.mp4?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>You start as a regular Y-Bot, but you don't have to look like everyone else! Customize your face, color, and hat to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/29bf414a131cd833e82b6b74c74f44da.webp?t=1741311128\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/12afa160e9d4f53bae6a9e20a26dd62d.poster.avif?t=1741311128\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/12afa160e9d4f53bae6a9e20a26dd62d.webm?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/12afa160e9d4f53bae6a9e20a26dd62d.mp4?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Explosions and lasers can destroy platforms in a dynamic and fun way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/1fc562cd225237b7fa597373c6852de3.webp?t=1741311128\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/70aa6344780172c4d49234b71eeae515.poster.avif?t=1741311128\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/70aa6344780172c4d49234b71eeae515.webm?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/70aa6344780172c4d49234b71eeae515.mp4?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Party Bots is full of new items to unlock. Are you lucky enough to get a really rare one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/c21745da221c25fa555395c03fdf7bb1.webp?t=1741311128\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/54f8a44abf3f259962e787a506aa31f9.poster.avif?t=1741311128\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/54f8a44abf3f259962e787a506aa31f9.webm?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/54f8a44abf3f259962e787a506aa31f9.mp4?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>You can take control of game modes yourself and change everything to your liking! Don't like the explosive barrels? Remove them! Want things to happen faster? Speed up the events! Is the game too easy for you? Make it harder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/7edeb92dcbd5147c791fd08c06eac3c8.webp?t=1741311128\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/3c6aab2b5e4474728152095b37250ba5.poster.avif?t=1741311128\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/3c6aab2b5e4474728152095b37250ba5.webm?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/3c6aab2b5e4474728152095b37250ba5.mp4?t=1741311128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>This can save you in the most dangerous situations, or just be fun!</p>",
